    <div class="lp-heading"><p class="lp-kicker">02 / Know the bill</p><h2>Apollo vs ZoomInfo pricing:<br>what will you pay?</h2><p>All amounts are USD, before tax and extras. Apollo's annual rates require a yearly commitment.</p></div>
    <div class="sg-table-wrap"><table class="lp-table sg-table az-plans" role="table"><caption>Published Apollo subscriptions and ZoomInfo's quote requirement</caption><thead><tr role="row"><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Plan</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Monthly billing</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Annual billing</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Included credits</th></tr></thead><tbody>
      {% for p in guide.plans %}<tr role="row" data-plan="{{ p.id }}"><th scope="row" role="rowheader">{{ p.name }}{% if p.minimumSeats > 1 %}<small>Minimum {{ p.minimumSeats }} seats</small>{% endif %}</th><td role="cell" data-label="Monthly billing">{% if p.monthly %}<strong>${{ p.monthly }}</strong><small>per user / month</small>{% else %}<strong class="az-quote">Annual only</strong>{% endif %}</td><td role="cell" data-label="Annual billing"><strong>${{ p.annualRate }}</strong><small>per user / month equivalent<br>${{ p.annualDisplay }} per user / year</small></td><td role="cell" data-label="Included credits">{{ p.creditsAnnualDisplay }} per user / year on annual billing{% if p.creditsMonthly %}<small>{{ p.creditsMonthlyDisplay }} per user / month on monthly billing</small>{% endif %}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
      <tr role="row" data-plan="zoominfo"><th scope="row" role="rowheader">ZoomInfo</th><td role="cell" data-label="Monthly billing"><strong class="az-quote">Quote required</strong><small>Confirm payment schedule and term</small></td><td role="cell" data-label="Annual billing"><strong class="az-quote">Quote required</strong></td><td role="cell" data-label="Included credits">Get the allowance for your exact package in writing</td></tr>
    </tbody></table></div>
    <p class="sg-sources"><a href="https://www.apollo.io/pricing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apollo's current pricing ↗</a> · <a href="https://www.zoominfo.com/pricing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ZoomInfo pricing and package rules ↗</a></p>
    <h3 class="az-subheading">The yearly subscription for 1, 3 or 5 users.</h3>
    <div class="sg-table-wrap"><table class="lp-table sg-table sg-costs az-team-costs" role="table"><caption>Annual subscription totals in USD at the annual rates above</caption><thead><tr role="row"><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Plan</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">1 user</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">3 users</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">5 users</th></tr></thead><tbody>
      {% for p in guide.plans %}<tr role="row" data-team-plan="{{ p.id }}"><th scope="row" role="rowheader">{{ p.name }}</th>{% for c in p.costs %}<td role="cell" data-label="{{ c.seats }} user{% if c.seats > 1 %}s{% endif %}"{% if c.value == null %} class="az-no-price"{% endif %}>{{ c.display }}{% if c.value != null %}<small>per year</small>{% endif %}</td>{% endfor %}</tr>{% endfor %}
      <tr role="row"><th scope="row" role="rowheader">ZoomInfo</th><td role="cell" class="az-no-price" data-label="1 user">Quote required</td><td role="cell" class="az-no-price" data-label="3 users">Quote required</td><td role="cell" class="az-no-price" data-label="5 users">Quote required</td></tr>
    </tbody></table></div>
    <p class="lp-small">Annual total = the annual monthly rate × paid users × 12. The minimum Apollo Organization purchase is $4,284 a year for three seats.</p>
    <div class="sg-two sg-after"><div><h3>Apollo's price can grow.</h3><p>Advanced power, parallel and international dialling adds $119 per team/month on annual billing, or $149 on monthly billing, on top of paid seats and usage. Five annual Professional seats plus that annual add-on total <strong>$6,168 a year before extra usage.</strong></p><p>Extra credit subscriptions keep renewing until you remove them, and unused credits expire.</p><p class="sg-sources"><a href="https://www.apollo.io/product/dialer" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Dialler features and add-on ↗</a> · <a href="https://knowledge.apollo.io/hc/en-us/articles/4677130104333-Customize-and-Manage-Your-Apollo-Plan" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Extra credits and subscription changes ↗</a></p></div><div><h3>ZoomInfo's contract needs a close look.</h3><p>Its November 2026 filing describes annual platform fees and prepaid credits alongside seat-based packages. It says subscription terms typically run one to three years and are non-cancelable.</p><p>Check the full contract term, because quarterly invoices can still leave you committed for years.</p><p class="sg-sources"><a href="https://zoominfotechnologiesinc.gcs-web.com/static-files/6c350fee-34b0-40f1-a15f-c81353e40350#page=39" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ZoomInfo's November 4 filing, page 39 ↗</a></p></div></div>
    <div class="lp-note"><strong>CallTeam verdict: get the price before the sales pitch.</strong><p>Ask for a price based on your team size and needs. If the provider still keeps the cost vague, keep shopping.</p></div>
